OL,3,GNEWSA'Oldest' surviving Rolls-Royce to
OL,4,Areturn to UK roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Rolls-Royce believed to be the
OL,7,Fworld's oldest surviving model will
OL,8,Freturn to British roads for the first
OL,9,Ftime in decades at the London to
OL,10,FBrighton Veteran Car Run.
OL,12,FThe 1904 vehicle is due to appear at
OL,13,Fthe St James's Motoring Spectacle in
OL,14,FLondon before joining the annual
OL,15,F60-mile (96.56km) event on 1 November.
OL,17,FChassis 20154, as the car is known, has
OL,18,Frecently undergone a three-year
OL,19,Frestoration which returned it to its
OL,20,Fformer glory, said the Royal Automobile
OL,21,FClub.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
