OL,3,GNEWSA'Oldest' surviving Rolls-Royce to
OL,4,Areturn to UK roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuncan Wiltshire, chairman of the
OL,7,Forganisation, said the car's
OL,8,Fparticipation was "particularly
OL,9,Fsignificant" because it is the only
OL,10,Fknown pre-1905 Rolls-Royce eligible for
OL,11,Fthe car run.
